      "pali": "“No hetaṁ, bhante”. ",
      "english": "“No, sir.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "pali": "“Iti kho, bhikkhave, yadaniccaṁ taṁ dukkhaṁ. ",
      "english": "“And so, what’s impermanent is suffering. "
    },
    {
      "number": 33,
      "pali": "Tasmiṁ sati, tadupādāya evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
      "english": "When this exists, grasping at this, the view arises: "
